{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"ae676474b592efc8ce50793bf8bcf21716f96f8c39d3ac0db74c832095d0e98f","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_761f6e2b675b5581a1af1a460f31c8f72993f60fd11233df0b82d57808baa487","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical optimization method without addressing ethical, privacy, or broader impact considerations. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with specific venue policies regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or mandatory impact statements, as no such policy documents or external overlap checks are available.","paper_id":"By1snw5gl","paper_identity_sha256":"ab2422b1f6a27828e48f962f9bc44f7ec6790216b9c783d76b75c60ff4c98aa5","prompt_identity_sha256":"f88ceeb6711492ee02298648f26998eb83b84a47c6ca307e4d3c3c4f18beb49c","raw_response_sha256":"7fad5e8135ea957c0909578481d5fbc27b6f5bf55bacbe49a904b17e09d7bbcd","request_identity_sha256":"e5ac75909335b92c9e69bb18dc21b0c69f53d2ffe06017df701ab7cde9d295cf","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"829eeac5d4f7b9aae90d373379a8789d8e4139871297ca9a38d4f88f4864c0a1","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper focuses exclusively on the mathematical formulation and experimental performance of the L-SR1 optimization algorithm. It does not discuss potential ethical risks, fairness, bias, or societal harms associated with the use of this optimization method in deep learning applications. No material ethical-risk pathway is visible in the text.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-017"],"review_text":"The experiments utilize the MNIST and CIFAR10 datasets. The paper does not contain any statements regarding data licensing, consent, or privacy compliance for these datasets. As these are standard public benchmarks, no specific privacy violations are evident in the text, but the absence of explicit compliance claims means the supplied evidence is insufficient to verify adherence to specific data-use policies.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper explicitly lists the authors' names (Vivek Ramamurthy, Nigel Duffy), their affiliation (Sentient Technologies), physical address, and email addresses on the first page. While this is standard for non-anonymous submissions, the corpus build lacks a frozen venue/year anonymity policy to determine if this constitutes a double-blind violation. Therefore, no policy violation or clearance can be declared based on the supplied evidence.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper cites relevant prior work and claims that no complete L-SR1 method was previously described in the literature. However, the supplied evidence does not include external plagiarism checks, overlap analysis, or information regarding dual submission. Therefore, the evidence is insufficient to confirm originality or rule out plagiarism and dual submission.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, ethics checklist, or discussion of societal implications. Without a frozen policy obligation requiring such statements for this specific venue and year, the absence of these sections cannot be judged as a compliance failure. The supplied paper-only evidence is insufficient to determine if required compliance documentation is missing.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"f4f8055b95ae0fb983c33becc40b8c843d8ab121e141f2460fe2dc42a12809fd","paper_id":"By1snw5gl","paper_ordinal":65,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"7fad5e8135ea957c0909578481d5fbc27b6f5bf55bacbe49a904b17e09d7bbcd","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"By1snw5gl","raw_provider_response_base64":"",